      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I completely support this! If someone is in FBT, they more than likely want to be able to use their real body to position themselves how they want, or at least be given the option to. Being able to FBT walk around while still parented to a moving vehicle of some kind would be incredibly useful for RPers and photographers too, so your helicopter scenario is a perfect example of this",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
